      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>A special value for the line breaking style option.</para>
          <para>The auto option selects a line-break style based on the locale of the text rendering context. You can set the context locale with <see cref="P:Android.Widget.TextView.TextLocales" /> or <see cref="P:Android.Graphics.Paint.TextLocales" />.</para>
          <para>If the first locale in a text run's locale list supports Japanese script, this option is equivalent to <see cref="F:Android.Graphics.Text.LineBreakStyle.Strict" />; otherwise, it is equivalent to <see cref="F:Android.Graphics.Text.LineBreakStyle.None" />.</para>
          <para>Note: future versions may have special line breaking style rules for other locales.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/graphics/text/LineBreakConfig#LINE_BREAK_STYLE_AUTO" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.graphics.text.LineBreakConfig.LINE_BREAK_STYLE_AUTO</code>.</a></format></para>
          <para>Portions of this page are modifications based on work created and shared by the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/site-policies" title="Android Open Source Project">Android Open Source Project</a></format> and used according to terms described in the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.5/" title="Creative Commons 2.5 Attribution License">Creative Commons 2.5 Attribution License.</a></format></para>
        </summary>
      </Docs>
    </Member>
